81a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两山竹枝歌 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"橘绿橙黄香满校，瓮头篘玉鲙鱼丝。\n山中历日由来少，知是江南九月时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12617,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两山竹枝歌 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"白雪缫成茧子绵，黄云剪就稻花天。\n千家村里无开市，二尺溪头有系船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12618,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两山竹枝歌 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"短短钗银压鬓鸦，围腰群捉木绵花。\n莫嫌村坞行人少，夫婿经商不在家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12619,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两山竹枝歌 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"峨舸大艑碧波间，遍截玲珑稛载还。\n最是三吴多好事，家家分得洞庭山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12620,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题虎丘剑池","author":"王世贞","text":"吴王爱女瘗山丘，宝剑三千白虎游。\n当时未解平亲怨，又见胥江洗属镂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12621,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆羽泉","author":"王世贞","text":"康王谷瀑中泠水，何似山僧屋后泉。\n客至试探禅悦味，玉团初辗浪花圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12622,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"tit